abstract: "Research on uncertainty quantification for emotion tagging, crisis-post deprioritization, and sentiment classification. Includes exact-binomial selected-risk calibration, synthetic verification, frozen-evidence replay for GoEmotions, HumAID and TweetEval Sentiment, and reproducible aggregate tables and figures."
keywords:
  - social media analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - selective prediction
  - crisis informatics
  - sentiment analysis
  - statistical risk control
